    "head_commit_message": "test(native): cut the field logs for the snapshot tests (spec 39 step 8d-ii) (#697)\n\n* feat(native): carry a field's own state beside the crate's\n\nFieldPlay::carried writes what a field log keeps beside the snapshot (the\nsquads listed, the definitions coded, the routes' codes, the waves, the\nbuilders' work and reserve, hurry and tending); FieldPlay::carrying sets\nthe field up from its record again and lays that over it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi2epF3P2hExj2PS5Uu\n\n* test(native): cut the field logs for the snapshot tests\n\nA cut of a field log carries FieldPlay's own state (<name>.field) and is\nstepped with the record's commands for its tick. Three field cuts (field1\nat 120, field2 at 229, field3 at 470) cover the pathing, the withdrawal and\nthe carrying, which leave cuts::UNCHANGED. Closes spec 39 step 8 (8d-ii).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi2epF3P2hExj2PS5Uu\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
